EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I've been meaning to ask you{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Do you think the walls of my room
